@startuml request-lifecycle
title Request lifecycle (RequestStatus / RequestTransitions)
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> PENDING : Team Lead submits

PENDING --> QUERIED : Manager queries
QUERIED --> PENDING : Team Lead clarifies

PENDING --> APPROVED : Manager approves
PENDING --> PARTIALLY_APPROVED : line quantities\npartly approved
PENDING --> REJECTED : Manager rejects
PENDING --> WAITLISTED : Manager waitlists
QUERIED --> REJECTED : Manager rejects

APPROVED --> COMPLETED : all lines fulfilled /\naccepted / waived
PARTIALLY_APPROVED --> COMPLETED : all lines fulfilled /\naccepted / waived
WAITLISTED --> COMPLETED : all lines fulfilled /\naccepted / waived

PENDING --> CANCELLED : Team Lead cancels
QUERIED --> CANCELLED : Team Lead cancels
APPROVED --> CANCELLED : Team Lead cancels\nbefore issue
PARTIALLY_APPROVED --> CANCELLED : Team Lead cancels\nbefore issue
WAITLISTED --> CANCELLED : Team Lead cancels\nbefore issue

@enduml
